sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has implemented device model monitoring and MonitoringCtrlr.Enabled = true
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: CSMS requests ClearVariableMonitoring ItemsPerMessage from CS
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Manually instruct CSMS to get a report of monitors for:<br>- all DeltaMonitoring

    CSMS->>CS: GetMonitoringReportRequest (monitoringCriteria = DeltaMonitoring)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: monitoringCriteria = DeltaMonitoring<br>componentVariable is omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: GetMonitoringReportResponse (status = EmptyResultSet)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Manually instruct CSMS to get a report of monitors for:<br>- all ThresholdMonitoring

    CSMS->>CS: GetMonitoringReportRequest (monitoringCriteria = ThresholdMonitoring)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: monitoringCriteria = ThresholdMonitoring<br>componentVariable is omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: GetMonitoringReportResponse (status = Accepted)

    loop Repeated as often as needed to report all configuration variables
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyMonitoringReportRequest
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyMonitoringReportResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validation: Check that CSMS shows the Threshold monitors
